@startuml seq-cu06
!include _estilo.iuml
autonumber
hide footbox
title CU-06 Consultar lista de materiales (BOM)
actor Usuario as U
boundary "BomPage" as P
control "BomApiService" as S
participant "FastAPI\n(crud.project_collection)" as API
database "BD" as DB
U -> P : Abre hoja 02 LISTA DE MATERIALES
P -> S : getMaterials(projectId)
S -> API : GET /api/projects/{id}/bom
API -> API : ensure_project(id)
API -> DB : SELECT bom_materials WHERE project_id ORDER BY pk
API --> S : 200 BomMaterial[]
P --> U : Tabla: descripción, proveedor, tipo de cálculo\n(EXACTO / ESTIMADO), cantidad, precio, subtotal
note over P : Filas ESTIMADO muestran la nota metrológica\n(criterio de aproximación, RE-005 / RE-006).
opt Mantenimiento de la BOM (API)
  U -> API : POST | PATCH | DELETE /api/projects/{id}/bom[/{itemId}]
  API -> DB : INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE
end
@enduml
